# =============================================================================
# WCS Survey Editor — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This repo must NEVER contain Fenesta order data. The app reads customer
# PDFs and produces annotated PDFs, workbooks and sketch PNGs — all of which
# contain customer names, site addresses, order numbers and dimensions.
# Everything the app can write is excluded below.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. CUSTOMER DATA — the important part
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Order PDFs (input) and annotated PDFs (output)
*.pdf

# Combined Excel exports
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.csv

# Sketch PNGs written when WCS_SKETCH_DIR is set
sketches/
**/sketches/

# Calibration previews. calibrate_sketch_box.py renders REAL order pages to
# PNG next to the PDF you point it at — if you run it inside the repo folder
# those are full customer page images. Excluded explicitly.
sketch_box_preview/
**/sketch_box_preview/

# Any ad-hoc exports
output/
outputs/
exports/
annotated_*.pdf
*_survey_*.xlsx

# Screenshots — these often contain live order details
screenshot*.png
image.png
Screenshot*.png

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. SECRETS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Streamlit secrets (Power Automate flow URL, any future connection strings).
# On Community Cloud these belong in the app's Secrets settings, not the repo.
.streamlit/secrets.toml
secrets.toml
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. PYTHON
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# Test / lint caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. EDITORS / OS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Office lock files (appear when a workbook is open)
~$*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. SCRATCH
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
mock.pdf
test_*.pdf
test_*.png
scratch/
tmp/
temp/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   assets/fenesta-logo.png   — needed for the app to render its header.
#                               Fine in a PRIVATE repo. If this repo is
#                               PUBLIC, confirm with Fenesta brand/IT that
#                               publishing the logo is acceptable.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
